Build the morning brief per knowledge/domains/dream-loop.md ("Morning brief"): machine heartbeat (which fleet jobs ran/skipped overnight, from ~/.local/state/fleet/*.log), bus threads with 2+ witnesses, latest dream verdict, watchdog P1s, Jira moves (Atlassian MCP), repo commits since yesterday.

FIRST, run: python3 ~/.claude/knowledge/scripts/decision-inbox.py — then LEAD the brief with its "Today" list (the single ranked, budgeted decision surface). That is what Josh acts on. Do NOT surface the harness-meta auto lane in the brief: those findings are worked by the harness-fix job without him. Mention the meta lane count in one line at most ("N harness-meta items handled").

Also include a "Proposal decisions needed" section: run python3 ~/.claude/knowledge/scripts/proposal-pipeline.py and list each proposed/accepted item with the gardener's recommended yes/no (from the latest garden report) — these are Josh's one-word approvals for the day.

Write knowledge/morning-brief/$(date +%F).md. Keep it one screen. Do not post to Slack (routing not decided yet). When done, Bash-append {"ts":"<now UTC ISO>","job":"morning-brief"} to ~/.claude/knowledge/garden-reports/heartbeat.jsonl.
